'''Volume 5: Going Coconuts''' is the fifth of ten volumes of the [[Magical Pokémon Journey]] manga created by [[Yumi Tsukirino]].

==Blurb==
'''IN THIS VOLUME…'''

{{TP|Hazel|Pikachu}} and {{TP|Hazel|Clefairy}} get stuck babysitting a bratty {{p|Oddish}}; [[Coconut]] hypnotizes [[Almond]] to find his true love; [[Hazel]] goes on a quest for a foolproof love charm; {{TP|Pistachio|Bulbasaur}} learns a valuable lesson at a sadistic fat farm; our Pokémon and human friends celebrate Christmas; plus many more stories starring all your most favorite characters!

